{"games":[{"id":9870517705,"name":"Paradox [RELEASE]","desc":"This game may prove to pose a learning curve in the higher ranks, and has little hand holding for new players.\n\nIf you have bought the emote gamepass, please make sure you rejoin if you were already in game just in case, and then you can just hit K to open up the menu.\n\nControls:\nLeft Click - M1\nR - Critical\nF - Block / Parry\nQ - Dash\nShift - Run\nLeft Alt - Shiftlock\nB - Grip\nG - Carry\nV - Activate Special\nM - Open Menu\nN - Meditate\nComma - Show NPCS in range\nRight Click - Feint Flashstep/Dash/M1","path":"/game/9870517705-paradox","slug":"9870517705-paradox","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e3492d78f90f61d81801770e332ba043f0ce2bb645badeb065bed7cc7e0c7b26.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0e0074e4e72b12b9433b741c807913cd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":9878917,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-24T17:58:54.533Z","creator":{"name":"a bleach game","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":9,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":4,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":9524757503,"name":"iHeartLand: Music Tycoon","desc":"Tycoon but it’s iHeartland is coming to you on a NEW frequency!📡\n\nCreate Your Music Tower Empire! 📻🏙️\n\n🎶 Tap Music Notes to Harvest Sound Energy from Soundfields\n\n🔋 Deposit Sound Energy at the Jukebox to Gain iHeartBucks\n\n📻 Collect and Upgrade Radio Pets to Farm Faster\n\n🛠️ Build Your Radio Station Tower 11-Stories High! \n\n🎙️🕺 Build a Floor for Everything! From Country & HipHop to a Podcast Studio and Dance floor \n\n🏗️ Visit your Friend’s Tower!\n\n🆕 Unlock New Zones, Pets & Soundfields!\n\nBecome the ULTIMATE Radio Tower Tycoon NOW!! \n \n✨22 K Likes = NEW PROMO CODE!✨","path":"/game/9524757503-iheartland-music-tycoon","slug":"9524757503-iheartland-music-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2fe9f8c02fc48e87afd814eb2e648bda253c8a603f8ef5cf894247cfcf886eb0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-182166d75d53d69d909777c8eb6a4c3e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":13757640,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-27T15:23:30.005Z","creator":{"name":"iHeartRadio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8967359816,"name":"24kGoldn Concert Experience","desc":"THANK YOU for visiting the 24kGoldn Concert Experience on Roblox! While 24kGoldn might not be performing on Roblox anymore, you can still check out his new single In My Head and collect 24 golden microphones to earn the Golden Sunglasses!\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nMULTI-PLATINUM RECORDING ARTIST 24kGoldn is bringing his golden touch to Roblox with his El Dorado Concert Experience! Along with his biggest hits, he will be performing his new song “In My Head” for the first time! The concert premieres on Friday, March 25th at 4 PM PST & re-airs hourly all weekend. Until then, shop 24kGoldn merch, complete the scavenger hunt & more!\r\n\r\nFollow the developer: @gamefamstudios\r\n","path":"/game/8967359816-24kgoldn-concert-experience","slug":"8967359816-24kgoldn-concert-experience","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d6ab265526e55195cc409f9a1a5a379dfe45dec124b4243419127dca36858958.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-87249609dae614261c1058785f217b72/150/150/UnapprovedImage/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":23085433,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-03-22T10:06:28.045Z","creator":{"name":"24kGoldn Official Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9115412844,"name":"The Tall Man [DISCONTINUED]","desc":"","path":"/game/9115412844-the-tall-man","slug":"9115412844-the-tall-man","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9616411936,"name":"Man City Blue Moon","desc":"⚽ StickerBook Cha